git-svn-id: https://svn.apache.org/repos/asf/lucene/dev/trunk@1036977 13f79535-47bb-0310-9956-ffa450edef68

Here is the root cause:
The `FilterIndexReader` class did not correctly implement the `getSequentialSubReaders()` method, returning `null` instead of delegating the call to the underlying `IndexReader` instance. This led to incorrect behavior when attempting to retrieve sequential sub-readers, which is essential for the proper functioning of index reading operations.

